Mastering ArgoCD for GitOps!
ArgoCD, the declarative GitOps tool that’s revolutionizing how we manage Kubernetes deployments.

🔹 What is ArgoCD?
A GitOps-centric continuous delivery tool that syncs Kubernetes manifests from Git repositories to clusters, ensuring the desired state matches the source of truth.
🔹 Core Concepts:
Declarative Deployments: Define apps in Git, and ArgoCD auto-syncs the cluster.
Automated Sync & Self-Healing: Detects drift and reconciles changes.
Visual UI & CLI: Monitor deployments via dashboard or command-line.
Multi-Environment Support: Manage dev/stage/prod with ease using Kustomize/Helm.
.
🔹 Why ArgoCD?
✅ Auditability: Track changes via Git history.
✅ Consistency: No more manual kubectl apply!
✅ Security: RBAC-integrated and cluster-scoped permissions.
